#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:5
#: d2b8ef58a94c4901a77394cf7e86ca42
msgid "i-BUS Telemetry"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:7
#: 8f63438bc5d746b69179c72ecd4a1935
msgid "i-BUS telemetry allows you to display ArduPilot information such as flight modes, battery level, and speed, as well as information from other supported i-BUS telemetry values on `Flysky <https://www.flysky-cn.com/plane>`__ and Turnigy transmitters (using stock, modified, or OpenTX firmware) when using an i-BUS receiver with a SENS port (such as the `iA6B <https://www.flysky-cn.com/ia6b-canshu>`__, `FTr8B <https://www.flysky-cn.com/ftr8bspecifications>`__, etc)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:9
#: 648bbf12bb28462f85432f93c6f55614
msgid "It is particularly useful:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:11
#: de226f35fd0c4283849993dc2280dc17
msgid "for flying without a ground control station (no need for MAVLink telemetry radio),"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:12
#: 952ffe9a903147f99506f0efcc649600
msgid "as a backup in case the ground station fails (e.g., loss of MAVLink radio link),"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:13
#: fa063b889fba43819036ea59f7131563
msgid "when a separate person operates the ground control station,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:14
#: 8659d60cbda9446ba1c2fc831c1b8dbc
msgid "for quick situational awareness by the pilot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:16
#: d2fd31d680e846139f783a095aece1fc
msgid "Moreover, some RC transmitters such as the Flysky FS-i6X can be modified with OpenTX firmware, enabling a lot more functionality based on incoming telemetry than stock firmware allows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:22
#: 735ff286a6944d2faad158d446597fdd
msgid "i-BUS Telemetry setup with Flysky FS-i6 transmitter running stock firmware."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:26
#: 387f89c4d45f485fab2ee06157a5787b
msgid "Setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:28
#: d961276e7e8b41b5b7b6c40a0c48c78e
msgid "Support for this peripheral is included on all boards with *more* than 2MB flash memory. It is also available for other boards using the `Custom Firmware Build Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ , by creating a firmware build including this feature listed under the Telemetry category."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:30
#: 0ea7c9d3f10348999e74bd586928ca49
msgid "In order to use i-BUS telemetry, the following steps are required:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:32
#: 2344292966f04cdc984d451c6f40d75f
msgid "Connect the TX pin of an autopilot telemetry port to the signal pin of your i-BUS receiver's SENS interface. No voltage or ground pins should be needed as the receiver will already be powered by the PPM RC connection or the servo rail."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:33
#: ecccbb0be35b48618d4de26857ce61ec
msgid "Configure the autopilot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:34
#: f1c48f8aa22a46c9a6a34aa884260adc
msgid "Enable telemetry display on your supporting transmitter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:38
#: 781218b612b74697876e172a05657ed9
msgid "Configuring ArduPilot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:40
#: 392e4bd92be34678ad545085c1e8bd6d
msgid "Set the following parameters for the telemetry port used:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:42
#: 87facd1c4abf4d3ca2dd04b6a413394e
msgid "``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 49"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:43
#: 8605eafba3f5457084ecec32538bd8b0
msgid "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 0 / cleared as the library will set its own options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:45
#: aba492f752f04d3f87e5a06ad4fe840a
msgid "``SERIALX_BAUD`` doesn't matter as the library will set its own baud"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:47
#: 3fe9ed21601440f9b5c4891c78eaa633
msgid "SERIAL port numbers do not necessarily directly correspond to UART or TELEM port labels. See the hardware documentation for your :ref:`autopilot <common-autopilots>`."
